            [CompletionResult]::new('get-eim-configuration-data', 'get-eim-configuration-data', [CompletionResultType]::ParameterValue, 'What an IoT eUICC says about its EIM: id, FQDN, id type, counter value, association token and every supported protocol (SGP.32 GetEimConfigurationData, ES10b). Read-only. The counter value and the association token are DER INTEGERs and are decoded as their value, not as the octets that carry it')
